				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Work out yesterday's calendar day in local time.

- The first Date action is yesterday at 00:00 and is the start of the day we want.
- The second Date action is today at 00:00 and is the end of the day we want.
- Format Date turns yesterday's date into the plain year-month-day text the web app expects, for example 2026-09-12.
